# 8. Active Directory Password Reset

Basic Help Desk workflow:

```text
Verify user's identity
        ↓
Locate user in ADUC
        ↓
Reset Password
        ↓
Set temporary password
        ↓
Require password change if company policy requires
        ↓
User attempts login
        ↓
Verify
        ↓
Document
```

Microsoft's ADUC workflow supports resetting passwords and can also provide an option to unlock a locked account during the password-reset process.

